! Proposed Definitions And Examples

{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ri'a (BAI)

!!! Proposed Definition
With cause... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is caused by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
rinka modal

!!! See Also
* {rinka}
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {se ri'a}
* {te ri'a}
* {ri'a nai}
* {se ri'a nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* cause
* because

!!! Usage Examples

''.i le bolci cu farlu ri'a lo nu mi co'u sarji ri''%%%
The ball fell because I stopped holding it up.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ri'a ma (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

With what cause? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of rinka and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks what physically caused the event described by the bridi.  

!!! Proposed Tag
rinka modal question

!!! See Also
* {rinka}
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ri'a}
* {se ri'a}
* {te ri'a}
* {ri'a nai}
* {se ri'a nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* With what cause?
* How?

!!! Usage Examples
mi na djuno lo du'u ri'a ma kau mi cortu le stedu
I don't know why my head hurts.

Artificial:
''.i ri'a ma le tsani cu blanu''%%%
Why is the sky blue?
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ri'a nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Not caused by... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of rinka. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of na'e rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is not caused by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e rinka modal

!!! See Also
* {rinka}
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ri'a}
* {se ri'a}
* {te ri'a}
* {ri'a ma}
* {se ri'a nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Not caused by
* Regardles of cause.

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''.i mi nelci do ri'anai lo za'i do melbi''%%%
I like you, but not because you're beautiful.

!!! Notes

It should be noted (and this applies to all BAI+nai constructs) that while the above example asserts that "mi nelci do", and it asserts that this isn't a result of "do melbi", it does *not* assert "do melbi" one way or the other.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se ri'a (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

With result... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is the cause of the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
se rinka modal

!!! See Also
* {rinka}
* {ja'e}
* {mu'i}
* {ni'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ri'a}
* {te ri'a}
* {ri'a ma}
* {ri'a nai}
* {se ri'a nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* With result...

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:

''.i do darxi mi seri'a lo za'i mi cortu''%%%
You hit me, which results in my pain.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se ri'a nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Not resulting in... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of rinka. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of na'e rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi does not cause the event described by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e se rinka modal

!!! See Also
* {rinka}
* {ja'e}
* {mu'i}
* {ni'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ri'a}
* {se ri'a}
* {te ri'a}
* {ri'a ma}
* {ri'a nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Not resulting in...

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''.i do darxi le ve tivni seri'anai lonu ri se cikre''%%%
You hit the TV, but that doesn't result in it being repaired.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: te ri'a (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Caused under conditions... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is caused under the conditions described by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
te rinka modal

!!! See Also
* {rinka}
* {ja'e}
* {mu'i}
* {ni'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ri'a}
* {se ri'a}
* {ri'a ma}
* {ri'a nai}
* {se ri'a nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Caused under conditions...

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''.i le karce cu xe klama teri'a loza'i mi bilga lonu klama le zarci''%%%
When I have to go to the store, the car is a vehicle.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ni'i (BAI)

!!! Proposed Definition

By logic... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of nibli.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi follows logically from the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
nibli modal

!!! See Also
* {nibli}
* {ja'e}
* {mu'i}
* {ri'a}
* {ki'u}
* {se ni'i}
* {te ni'i}
* {ni'i ma}
* {ni'i nai}
* {se ni'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* By logic...

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:

''.i la platon mrobi'o ni'i le du'u py remna''%%%
Plato dies, which follows logically because he is human.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ni'i ma (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

By what logic? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of nibli.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of nibli and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks by what logic the event described by the bridi occurs.

!!! Proposed Tag
nibli modal question

!!! See Also: 
* {nibli}
* {ja'e}
* {ri'a}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ni'i}
* {se ni'i}
* {te ni'i}
* {ni'i nai}
* {se ni'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* By what logic?

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''do krici lo du'u gendra ni'i ma''%%%
"You believe that is grammatical by what logic?"
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ni'i nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Does not logically follow from... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of nibli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi does not logically follow from the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e nibli modal

!!! See Also
* {nibli}
* {ja'e}
* {ri'a}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ni'i}
* {se ni'i}
* {te ni'i}
* {ni'i ma}
* {se ni'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Does not logically follow from...
* Regardless of logical cause.

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''.i do bilga lonu pilno lo palku kei ni'inai loza'i do nanmu''%%%
Your being obliged to wear pants doesn't logically follow from the state of your being a man.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se ni'i (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Logically therefore... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of nibli.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the event described by the bridi logically leads to the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag

se nibli modal

!!! See Also
* {nibli}
* {ja'e}
* {mu'i}
* {ri'a}
* {ki'u}
* {ni'i}
* {te ni'i}
* {ni'i ma}
* {ni'i nai}
* {se ni'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Logically therefore...

!!! Usage Examples
''.i se ni'i ri cusku no da poi lojbo''%%%
Because of that, nothing lojbanic is expressed.

!!! Notes

The example used doesn't contain a main selbri.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se ni'i nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Does not logically entail... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of nibli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi does not logically entail the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e se nibli modal

!!! See Also
* {nibli}
* {ja'e}
* {ri'a}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ni'i}
* {se ni'i}
* {te ni'i}
* {ni'i ma}
* {ni'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Does not logically entail...

!!! Usage Examples
''lo gerku lo plini cu simsa le ka barda .i se ni'i nai bo ri xi re ri xi ci simsa le ka barda''%%%
Dogs are similar to planets in size; it does not therefore follow that planets are similar to dogs in size.%%%
(I don't actually have any idea what this person was talking about, but this is a real usage, very slightly modified.)
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: te ni'i (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Under logic system... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of nibli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the event described by the bridi occurs under the logic system described by the referent of the tagged sumti. 

!!! Proposed Tag
te nibli modal

!!! See Also
* {nibli}
* {ja'e}
