!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''li pa pi'i pa du li pa te ni'i lo cmaci''%%%
One times one is one, according to mathematics.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: mu'i (BAI)

!!! Proposed Definition

Because of motive... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the event described by the bridi occurs because of the motive described by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
mukti modal

!!! See Also
* mukti
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {ri'a}
* {ki'u}
* {se mu'i}
* {te mu'i}
* {mu'i ma}
* {mu'i nai}
* {se mu'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Because of motive...

!!! Usage Examples
''.i mi cliva mu'i le nu samru'e kelci gi'e sipna do'e le mi se prami''%%%
I leave motivated by computer gaming and sleeping with my beloved.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: mu'i ma (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

With what motive? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of mukti.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of mukti and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks with what motive the event described by the bridi occurs.

!!! Proposed Tag

mukti modal question

