!! cmavo: mu'i nai (BAI*)

!! Proposed Definition

Not motivated by... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is not motivated by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e mukti modal

