I like talking to you, regardless of the short amount of time.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se mu'i (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Motive therefore... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the event described by the bridi is the motive behind the event described by the referent of the tagged sumti.

