!!! Usage Examples
''.i mi mutce xagji se mu'i le nu mi pu'o citka'' (Modified from original.)%%%
I'm very hungry, which motivates that I am about to eat.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se mu'i nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Not motive for... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is not the motive for the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e se mukti modal

