!! cmavo: te mu'i (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Motive of person... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the event described by the bridi is somehow motivated by or motivates the person indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
te mukti modal

!!! See Also
* {mukti}
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {ri'a}
* {ki'u}
* {mu'i}
* {se mu'i}
* {mu'i ma}
* {mu'i nai}
* {se mu'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Motive of person...

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''mi klama le zarci te mu'i le mi mamta''%%%
I go to the store because of/to motivate my mom.%%%
(The English gloss is incurably inspecific)
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ki'u (BAI)

!!! Proposed Definition

Because of reason... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the event described by the bridi occurs for the reason indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
krinu modal

!!! See Also
* {krinu}
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {ri'a}
* {mu'i}
* {se ki'u}
* {ki'u ma}
* {ki'u nai}
* {se ku'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Because of reason...

!!! Usage Examples
''.i mi nelci la lojban ki'u lenu mi pensi ta'i le pe'a lojbo''%%%
I like lojban because I think in a figuratively lojbanic manner.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ki'u ma (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

With what reason? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of krinu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of krinu and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks with what reason the event described by the bridi occurs.  See also: krinu, ja'e, ri'a, mu'i, ni'i, ki'u, se ki'u, ki'u nai, se ku'i nai.

!!! Proposed Tag
krinu modal question

!!! See Also
* {krinu}
* {ja'e}
* {ni'i}
* {ri'a}
* {mu'i}
* {se ki'u}
* {ki'u ma}
* {ki'u nai}
* {se ku'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* With what reason?
* Why?

!!! Usage Examples
''.i ki'u ma do cusku zo co'o''%%%
Why do you say goodbye?
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ki'u nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Without reason... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is not reasonably justified by the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e krinu modal

!!! See Also
* {krinu}
* {ja'e}
* {ri'a}
* {ni'i}
* {ni'i}
* {ki'u}
* {se ki'u}
* {ki'u ma}
* {se ku'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Without reason...

!!! Usage Examples
Artificial:
''la uest cu se nabmi ge ki'u nai lo nu .u bu mitcinpa'i nanmu gi ki'u lo nu .u bu simlu lo ka djica lo nu pilno lo nu catni fi lo gubni jibri kei lo nu cpedu lo cinse nu selfu''%%%
"West is in trouble not because he is a gay man, but because he is a man who was apparently willing to use the power of his public office to solicit sexual favors."
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se ki'u (BAI*)

