* {ni'i}
* {ri'a}
* {mu'i}
* {ki'u}
* {ki'u ma}
* {ki'u nai}
* {se ku'i nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Reasonably therefore...
* thereby....

!!! Usage Examples
''.i mi ca gunka penmi seki'u le nu masno spuda'' (Slightly modified.)%%%
I am at a work meeting, which is the reason for my slow replies.
{BOX}
{BOX()}
!! cmavo: se ki'u nai (BAI*)

!!! Proposed Definition

Not a reason to... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the event described by the bridi is not the reason for the referent of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
na'e se krinu modal

