* {ki'u nai}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* Not a reason to...

!!! Usage Examples
''.i se ki'u nai bo mi jai bandu le nobli ke lojbo bangu lo vlatai zekri'' (Slightly modified.)%%%
Regardless of that reason, I defend the noble Lojban language against word-shape crimes.
